1
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,920
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:35,920
Father.

3
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,360
Even if I say it ten thousand times,

4
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,680
I will still be with Teacher.

5
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:41,120
Our love is sincere.

6
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:42,720
The Shen family has upheld
integrity for generations.

7
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:43,880
We have built our name on moral principle.

8
00:01:43,960 --> 00:01:45,680
I taught you the classics and propriety

9
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:48,800
not so you could defy human bonds.

10
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:50,400
That fine teacher of yours—

11
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:52,400
if he truly cared for you at all,

12
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:54,840
why would he personally

13
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:56,240
push you toward the
Empress's throne at court?

14
00:01:56,320 --> 00:01:58,080
Teacher must have his reasons.

15
00:01:58,160 --> 00:01:59,400
He said

16
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:01,920
even if condemned by
all and cursed by fate,

17
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:04,840
-he would still take my hand for life.
-Come to your senses.

18
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:05,840
Husband.

19
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:06,760
Sister Zhili.

20
00:02:11,880 --> 00:02:13,000
In all these years,

21
00:02:15,320 --> 00:02:17,440
this is the first time Father has hit me.

22
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:21,200
Husband. Zhili.

23
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:23,160
Both of you, calm down.

24
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:25,240
Zhili.

25
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:27,960
Your father has devoted himself to you.

26
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:29,760
When has he ever acted selfishly?

27
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:32,480
He fears one wrong step

28
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:33,960
will leave you regretting it for life.

29
00:02:37,040 --> 00:02:37,880
Mother.

30
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:40,000
If no one cares what I want,

31
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:42,080
then I can only decide for myself.

32
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:44,200
I'm going to the palace to see His
Majesty.

33
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:46,080
-His Majesty will know what to do.
-Stop her.

34
00:02:46,160 --> 00:02:47,560
-Sister Zhili.
-Stop that unfilial girl!

35
00:02:47,640 --> 00:02:49,000
Until the ancestral ceremony,

36
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:51,280
you are not to leave this room.

37
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:52,200
Move.

38
00:02:54,320 --> 00:02:55,160
Sister.

39
00:02:55,920 --> 00:02:56,960
If you walk out that door,

40
00:02:57,040 --> 00:02:59,080
you'll put the Shen family in grave
danger.

41
00:02:59,160 --> 00:03:00,960
I won't let you become a sinner for the
ages.

42
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:03,920
I thought

43
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:07,080
only Zhili was fit to stand beside His
Majesty.

44
00:03:07,160 --> 00:03:08,640
I even invoked the Royal Command Tally

45
00:03:08,720 --> 00:03:09,600
to force His Majesty's hand.

46
00:03:10,480 --> 00:03:11,640
I never imagined...

47
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:14,320
How can I face His Majesty now?

48
00:03:15,600 --> 00:03:18,440
Or the ancestors of the Shen family?

49
00:03:25,320 --> 00:03:26,960
After checking through multiple sources,

50
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:29,360
This cross clearly points
to the character "Gu."

51
00:03:29,440 --> 00:03:31,000
Doukou can testify

52
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:32,440
that Gu Qin killed his wife and father,

53
00:03:33,480 --> 00:03:35,560
but we still lack solid proof

54
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:36,680
that he colluded with Ling Yunfei.

55
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:38,280
Justice has a way of revealing itself.

56
00:03:39,720 --> 00:03:41,480
While Di Nian and I were
hunting down the Blood Moon Society,

57
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,720
we made an unexpected discovery.

58
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,640
Tomorrow happens to be Gu Qin's birthday.

59
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:48,360
Let's give him a grand gift together.

60
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:52,640
And one more thing.

61
00:03:53,720 --> 00:03:55,040
Once he confesses and faces punishment,

62
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:57,840
I will immediately settle
the matter of appointing an Empress.

63
00:03:58,920 --> 00:03:59,760
Your Majesty.

64
00:04:01,160 --> 00:04:02,440
There is one thing
I still do not understand.

65
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:06,200
Grand Tutor Shen has always
understood Your Majesty best,

66
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:08,280
and has always let Zhili
make her own choices.

67
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:10,040
Why, then, would the Grand Tutor

68
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:12,120
insist on making Zhili Empress?

69
00:04:12,760 --> 00:04:13,760
And that day,

70
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:15,560
outside the imperial study,

71
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:19,760
I saw the struggle in Your Majesty's eyes.

72
00:04:20,640 --> 00:04:22,400
Was it also because of
something the Grand Tutor said?

73
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:27,000
Rest assured.

74
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:30,880
I have never wavered in my feelings for
you.

75
00:04:31,680 --> 00:04:33,480
No matter what happens from now on,

76
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:36,720
I will clear every obstacle
from your path beforehand.

77
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:41,320
Your Majesty.

78
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,960
What I have sought all my life

79
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:46,760
was never a phoenix crown
and bridal robes,

80
00:04:46,840 --> 00:04:49,040
but a position of real authority.

81
00:04:49,840 --> 00:04:51,960
When Zhili was nominated as Empress

82
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:53,560
and had to leave
the Office of Public Inquiry,

83
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:55,960
it pained me.

84
00:04:56,760 --> 00:04:58,520
Once I am named Empress,

85
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:00,240
I can no longer live on my own terms.

86
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:03,160
All my life's ambitions
would come to nothing.

87
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:06,400
I trust Your Majesty
to weigh everything carefully.

88
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:07,880
But opposing both Chancellors,

89
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:09,440
holding the ministers in check,

90
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:11,520
and finding a way
to answer the Grand Tutor...

91
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:13,600
the path of an emperor is too difficult.

92
00:05:14,760 --> 00:05:16,520
Perhaps we should take one step back

93
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:19,400
and return to being sovereign and subject.

94
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:20,800
For Your Majesty,

95
00:05:21,440 --> 00:05:22,560
and for me,

96
00:05:23,880 --> 00:05:26,560
perhaps that is the best outcome for now.

97
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:29,000
Difficult...

98
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:31,080
Does being difficult mean
we simply give up?

99
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:33,040
That does not sound like you.

100
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:34,960
Nor does it sound like me.

101
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:36,480
I told you,

102
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:39,720
I want you beside me
through every season and festival.

103
00:05:40,880 --> 00:05:42,240
Every promise I have made to you,

104
00:05:44,400 --> 00:05:45,920
I will keep.

105
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:12,920
Are you Mo Yuhan
of the Blood Moon Society?

106
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:13,840
I am.

107
00:06:14,880 --> 00:06:16,440
I am Zhao Hui, envoy of Beijian.

108
00:06:16,520 --> 00:06:17,760
By order of my sovereign,

109
00:06:17,840 --> 00:06:19,160
I have come to discuss
a great undertaking with you.

110
00:06:26,400 --> 00:06:27,280
Tell your sovereign

111
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:28,920
the Blood Moon Society

112
00:06:29,440 --> 00:06:30,600
has no welcome for Beijian.

113
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:52,640
Who are you really?

114
00:06:53,280 --> 00:06:55,640
How dare you impersonate me
and kill Beijian's envoy,

115
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:57,280
then frame the Blood Moon Society?

116
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:08,720
Shen Zhishu.

117
00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:10,280
You people...

118
00:07:10,880 --> 00:07:12,120
think you can restore your kingdom?

119
00:07:12,840 --> 00:07:13,680
Kill them.

120
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:16,000
Leave no one alive.

121
00:08:41,040 --> 00:08:42,760
Ying Gua's lackeys.

122
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:44,400
You're nothing special.

123
00:09:25,920 --> 00:09:27,200
Second Young Master.

124
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:46,800
The foolish thing anyone can do

125
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:48,760
is starve themselves.

126
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:50,000
It only hurts

127
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:51,640
the people who care about you most.

128
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:54,560
Father made your favorite
sweet-and-sour ribs.

129
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:56,240
Have a bite.

130
00:09:56,880 --> 00:09:59,320
You all keep saying you care about me,

131
00:09:59,400 --> 00:10:01,040
but has anyone asked

132
00:10:03,080 --> 00:10:04,760
how much this hurts me?

133
00:10:07,800 --> 00:10:09,600
Then put your hand over your heart

134
00:10:09,680 --> 00:10:10,520
and ask yourself

135
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:12,600
whether you have even
the slightest doubt.

136
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:14,320
And Doukou already...

137
00:10:14,400 --> 00:10:15,400
Enough.

138
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:18,240
Unless I see it with my own eyes

139
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:19,360
and hear it with my own ears,

140
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:25,200
Zhili.

141
00:10:27,600 --> 00:10:29,520
You may distrust anyone in this world,

142
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:32,360
but could you

143
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:33,360
trust me just this once?

144
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:37,840
No one wants your happiness more than I
do.

145
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:44,960
Anian.

146
00:10:46,880 --> 00:10:48,040
Then help me.

147
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:50,320
Let me see him.

148
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:52,520
I want to hear him say it himself.

149
00:10:52,600 --> 00:10:55,160
If he has betrayed me,
I will give up on him.

150
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:02,360
I'd rather you hate me now

151
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:08,040
than stand by

152
00:11:08,520 --> 00:11:10,640
and watch you leap off a cliff.

153
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:21,000
Anian.

154
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:24,440
The bitterest thing in this world

155
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:26,480
is not love or hatred,

156
00:11:27,440 --> 00:11:28,680
but regret.

157
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:44,400
Today, I prepared this banquet

158
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:45,440
according to the honors due a prince.

159
00:11:45,520 --> 00:11:47,840
Only that befits the Right Chancellor's
merit.

160
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:49,920
This first cup

161
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:50,960
is to your birthday.

162
00:11:54,120 --> 00:11:55,840
Your Majesty has shown me
unprecedented favor.

163
00:11:55,920 --> 00:11:56,880
Such grace has never been seen
in our dynasty.

164
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:58,280
I will remember it with gratitude.

165
00:11:58,360 --> 00:11:59,640
My life is fulfilled.

166
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:03,360
Congratulations, Right Chancellor.

167
00:12:03,440 --> 00:12:05,840
I have also prepared a modest gift.

168
00:12:05,920 --> 00:12:07,120
It will be presented
at the auspicious hour.

169
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:09,160
Please wait a little longer.

170
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:10,720
How thoughtful of you, Director Meng.

171
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:12,080
As a woman,

172
00:12:12,160 --> 00:12:13,560
to hold the post of Director

173
00:12:13,640 --> 00:12:14,760
is rare enough.

174
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:16,520
Yet you still observe
every courtesy so carefully.

175
00:12:17,040 --> 00:12:18,480
The younger generation
is truly formidable.

176
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:24,440
-Congratulations, Right Chancellor.
-Congratulations, Right Chancellor.

177
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:36,240
Attendants.

178
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:40,520
This is the birthday gift
I prepared for the Right Chancellor.

179
00:12:40,600 --> 00:12:41,960
I trust

180
00:12:42,640 --> 00:12:43,760
it will not disappoint you.

181
00:12:54,680 --> 00:12:56,040
Thank you for Your Majesty's great favor.

182
00:13:05,520 --> 00:13:06,760
Record of Loyal Ministers.

183
00:13:12,080 --> 00:13:13,160
Your Majesty.

184
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:29,200
I have an urgent matter to report.

185
00:13:29,280 --> 00:13:30,200
Your Majesty.

186
00:13:31,160 --> 00:13:32,560
I should not have interrupted,

187
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:34,720
but the Empress installation
ceremony is near.

188
00:13:35,760 --> 00:13:37,280
If I do not speak today,

189
00:13:37,360 --> 00:13:38,520
there will be no chance to turn back.

190
00:13:39,160 --> 00:13:40,120
Rise and speak.

191
00:13:48,680 --> 00:13:49,560
Teacher.

192
00:13:51,800 --> 00:13:53,680
That day, you gave me the Heart-Lock

193
00:13:54,160 --> 00:13:55,400
and promised we could live
as ordinary people.

194
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:57,040
You asked whether I was willing

195
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:58,440
to be brave for you once more.

196
00:13:59,520 --> 00:14:00,720
Today, I want to ask:

197
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:03,800
does that promise still stand?

198
00:14:13,560 --> 00:14:14,560
Your Majesty.

199
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:16,280
I am guilty.

200
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:18,240
I failed in my teaching

201
00:14:18,320 --> 00:14:19,520
and caused Zhili to confuse

202
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:21,760
the bond between teacher and student
with love between a man and woman.

203
00:14:22,640 --> 00:14:24,560
But this Heart-Lock
and promise of a common life

204
00:14:24,640 --> 00:14:26,240
are entirely fabricated.

205
00:14:33,040 --> 00:14:34,880
Entirely fabricated?

206
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:37,240
Then were all the promises
you made me before

207
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:40,400
nothing but lies?

208
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:43,320
Zhili.

209
00:14:44,480 --> 00:14:45,680
You have disappointed me deeply.

210
00:14:45,760 --> 00:14:48,120
Who has bewitched you

211
00:14:48,680 --> 00:14:50,480
into inventing such treasonous lies?

212
00:14:56,920 --> 00:14:58,160
This Heart-Lock

213
00:14:59,160 --> 00:15:01,000
was given to me by your own hand.

214
00:15:01,080 --> 00:15:02,520
You carved it yourself.

215
00:15:02,600 --> 00:15:05,360
Must we find someone
to verify your handwriting too?

216
00:15:10,640 --> 00:15:12,160
You trample on true feelings

217
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:14,560
and built your reputation on lies.

218
00:15:16,560 --> 00:15:17,720
From this day forward,

219
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:20,440
I, Shen Zhili,

220
00:15:21,600 --> 00:15:22,960
sever all ties

221
00:15:23,880 --> 00:15:25,520
with you, Gu Qin.

222
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:34,920
Right Chancellor.

223
00:15:35,840 --> 00:15:37,480
If you loved Shen Zhili,

224
00:15:37,560 --> 00:15:39,440
why did you recommend her as Empress?

225
00:15:39,520 --> 00:15:41,440
What exactly were you trying to do?

226
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:46,040
Your Majesty, I have been wronged!

227
00:15:46,120 --> 00:15:48,200
Someone must resent
my position as Chancellor

228
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:50,080
and have manipulated Zhili
into framing me

229
00:15:50,160 --> 00:15:51,480
so they could put me to death.

230
00:15:51,560 --> 00:15:53,920
You call yourself
a virtuous Chancellor of Daning.

231
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:56,040
Then let this golden register
tell you today

232
00:15:56,120 --> 00:15:58,000
which deeds history cannot hide.

233
00:15:58,080 --> 00:15:59,200
Open it.

234
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:12,440
It's fake. Every word is fake!

235
00:16:12,520 --> 00:16:14,280
Truth and falsehood

236
00:16:14,360 --> 00:16:15,760
are not yours to argue away.

237
00:16:15,840 --> 00:16:17,680
My gift for you has arrived as well.

238
00:16:22,960 --> 00:16:24,120
Your Majesty, please see the truth.

239
00:16:24,200 --> 00:16:25,560
I am Doukou,

240
00:16:25,640 --> 00:16:27,480
Madam Yuan's dowry maid.

241
00:16:27,560 --> 00:16:28,840
I heard with my own ears

242
00:16:28,920 --> 00:16:30,800
the Right Chancellor confess
his feelings to Miss Shen.

243
00:16:30,880 --> 00:16:32,720
And I saw with my own eyes

244
00:16:32,800 --> 00:16:33,960
that it was he

245
00:16:34,040 --> 00:16:35,280
who stabbed her once,

246
00:16:36,920 --> 00:16:39,160
then again, killing my mistress.

247
00:16:39,840 --> 00:16:40,760
Poor Madam

248
00:16:40,840 --> 00:16:42,200
was already one month pregnant,

249
00:16:42,280 --> 00:16:43,560
yet he still...

250
00:16:43,640 --> 00:16:45,440
still had the heart to kill her.

251
00:16:45,520 --> 00:16:46,480
Wretched maid!

252
00:16:46,560 --> 00:16:47,960
Every word is a lie!

253
00:16:50,400 --> 00:16:51,640
Guards!

254
00:16:54,800 --> 00:16:56,440
I am Xue Leng, a condemned criminal,

255
00:16:56,520 --> 00:16:58,640
an assassin kept
by the Right Chancellor.

256
00:16:58,720 --> 00:17:00,200
All these years,

257
00:17:00,280 --> 00:17:02,560
he threatened the lives
of my wife and daughter

258
00:17:02,640 --> 00:17:04,720
and forced me
to carry out assassinations.

259
00:17:04,800 --> 00:17:06,080
At his orders,

260
00:17:06,160 --> 00:17:07,120
I killed Wan Kai with my own hands.

261
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:09,200
But I did not kill Liu Ruyan.

262
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:11,520
He killed her himself.

263
00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:13,520
The Right Chancellor

264
00:17:13,600 --> 00:17:16,320
has colluded with Ling Yunfei for years.

265
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:17,560
You vile slave!

266
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:18,720
How dare you slander me!

267
00:17:18,800 --> 00:17:20,560
I would never collude
with a bandit chieftain.

268
00:17:22,040 --> 00:17:23,080
Do you all know

269
00:17:23,760 --> 00:17:25,480
why Ling Yunfei
could evade the law for so long?

270
00:17:25,560 --> 00:17:28,160
Because the greatest protector behind him

271
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:31,720
was none other than Gu Qin,
Daning's virtuous Chancellor.

272
00:17:32,440 --> 00:17:34,600
Ling Yunfei is his younger half brother,

273
00:17:34,680 --> 00:17:36,480
who grew up outside the family.

274
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:40,040
Meng Tinghui, you are framing me!

275
00:17:47,640 --> 00:17:49,160
Gu Qin.

276
00:17:49,240 --> 00:17:50,720
You abused your authority

277
00:17:50,800 --> 00:17:51,720
to erase his household registration,

278
00:17:51,800 --> 00:17:54,320
turning Ling Yunfei
into a man who could not exist openly.

279
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:55,640
It was also you

280
00:17:55,720 --> 00:17:57,200
who had Ling Yunfei kill Chancellor Yuan

281
00:17:57,280 --> 00:17:59,000
so you could claim all the credit
for controlling the floods

282
00:17:59,080 --> 00:18:00,040
and rise to the chancellorship.

283
00:18:00,120 --> 00:18:01,080
And it was still you

284
00:18:02,080 --> 00:18:03,760
who ordered Ling Yunfei

285
00:18:03,840 --> 00:18:06,400
to use gambling dens and female students
to control the ministers,

286
00:18:06,480 --> 00:18:07,720
and planted women from Wanxiang House

287
00:18:07,800 --> 00:18:10,400
in your colleagues' homes as spies.

288
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:12,400
That official cap on your head

289
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:15,240
is soaked in your father-in-law's blood,
your brother's soul,

290
00:18:15,320 --> 00:18:16,240
and the lives of your wife and child.

291
00:18:17,040 --> 00:18:18,680
Can you still wear it with a clear
conscience?

292
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:24,080
Take them away.

293
00:18:34,440 --> 00:18:35,320
Gu Qin.

294
00:18:36,320 --> 00:18:37,640
The evidence is conclusive.

295
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:39,280
It is time to confess.

296
00:18:51,760 --> 00:18:52,600
Confess?

297
00:18:55,120 --> 00:18:56,080
Why should I?

298
00:18:58,040 --> 00:18:59,480
Chancellor Yuan only knew
how to sit in his room

299
00:18:59,560 --> 00:19:01,040
and write elegant policy essays.

300
00:19:01,120 --> 00:19:02,400
With one circle of his vermilion brush,

301
00:19:02,480 --> 00:19:03,760
he took all the glory.

302
00:19:03,840 --> 00:19:04,960
Why?

303
00:19:05,600 --> 00:19:06,800
Yes, I killed Chancellor Yuan.

304
00:19:08,080 --> 00:19:09,000
But I traded one man's life

305
00:19:09,080 --> 00:19:10,880
for ten years of peace
for the people of seven prefectures.

306
00:19:10,960 --> 00:19:12,200
Was that not worth it?

307
00:19:12,280 --> 00:19:13,840
Among all the high officials at court,

308
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:16,000
whose hands are not stained
with a colleague's blood?

309
00:19:16,080 --> 00:19:17,480
Why should I, Gu Qin, confess?

310
00:19:17,560 --> 00:19:19,240
The peace of those seven prefectures

311
00:19:19,320 --> 00:19:21,200
was won by hundreds of thousands
of soldiers and civilians.

312
00:19:21,640 --> 00:19:23,760
How dare you steal their merit for
yourself?

313
00:19:23,840 --> 00:19:25,320
Gu Qin.

314
00:19:25,400 --> 00:19:27,480
You keep claiming
everything was for the people,

315
00:19:27,560 --> 00:19:30,560
but their peace was never in your heart.

316
00:19:30,640 --> 00:19:32,440
You wanted to use other people's bones

317
00:19:33,120 --> 00:19:34,640
to pave your road to power.

318
00:19:34,720 --> 00:19:35,720
Meng Tinghui.

319
00:19:36,400 --> 00:19:38,640
You are noble. You are remarkable.

320
00:19:38,720 --> 00:19:40,080
Everyone loves you, Meng Tinghui.

321
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:42,080
Now you can stand above me

322
00:19:42,160 --> 00:19:44,640
and condemn me, despise me.

323
00:19:46,760 --> 00:19:48,120
But who knows

324
00:19:48,200 --> 00:19:49,640
how hard this road has been for me?

325
00:19:49,720 --> 00:19:51,760
I was born poor,
without power or influence.

326
00:19:52,800 --> 00:19:54,600
Anyone could trample over me.

327
00:19:54,680 --> 00:19:56,160
In the late Emperor's eyes,

328
00:19:56,240 --> 00:19:58,720
there were only Chancellor Yuan, Xu Ting,

329
00:19:58,800 --> 00:20:00,480
Shen Wuchen and those old ministers.

330
00:20:01,080 --> 00:20:02,680
I endured for ten years

331
00:20:02,760 --> 00:20:04,600
until His Majesty finally took the throne.

332
00:20:05,400 --> 00:20:08,200
But now you purge old ministers
and promote newcomers.

333
00:20:08,280 --> 00:20:11,160
Now even a woman
wants to climb over my head.

334
00:20:11,240 --> 00:20:12,640
If I do not kill everyone in my way,

335
00:20:12,720 --> 00:20:13,600
what else am I supposed to do?

336
00:20:13,680 --> 00:20:16,040
You are hardly the only official
born to a humble family.

337
00:20:16,960 --> 00:20:20,560
You blame your greed,
ambition, and cruelty

338
00:20:20,640 --> 00:20:22,680
on everyone else and on the world itself.

339
00:20:23,800 --> 00:20:24,640
Fine.

340
00:20:25,440 --> 00:20:27,200
Today I will let all Daning

341
00:20:27,280 --> 00:20:28,960
see exactly how vile and contemptible you
are.

342
00:20:35,320 --> 00:20:36,160
Yes.

343
00:20:38,760 --> 00:20:39,760
I am vile.

344
00:20:41,040 --> 00:20:41,880
Contemptible.

345
00:20:43,680 --> 00:20:45,960
All my life, I, Gu Qin,
have wanted only to rise.

346
00:20:46,920 --> 00:20:48,720
Step by step,

347
00:20:48,800 --> 00:20:51,640
higher and higher,

348
00:20:51,720 --> 00:20:54,200
until I reached
the highest halls of power.

349
00:20:54,280 --> 00:20:55,840
I wanted to become the mighty minister

350
00:20:55,920 --> 00:20:57,200
below only one man
and above everyone else.

351
00:21:00,760 --> 00:21:02,600
For that one day,

352
00:21:02,680 --> 00:21:04,080
I endured all these years

353
00:21:05,640 --> 00:21:07,120
and killed so many people.

354
00:21:08,200 --> 00:21:10,800
Why could none of you
simply let me have it?

355
00:21:10,880 --> 00:21:13,280
How could you think something so absurd?

356
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:15,720
How could you turn
a lifetime of resentment

357
00:21:15,800 --> 00:21:17,400
into a reason to draw your blade on
others?

358
00:21:17,480 --> 00:21:18,440
You vile woman!

359
00:21:20,800 --> 00:21:22,480
Even you look down on me.

360
00:21:24,240 --> 00:21:25,760
You're just like Yuan Lingyi.

361
00:21:26,480 --> 00:21:29,480
using your family name
to stand above me and condemn me.

362
00:21:34,720 --> 00:21:36,120
What imperial grace?

363
00:21:37,200 --> 00:21:38,800
What Zhangde Palace banquet?

364
00:21:39,520 --> 00:21:40,680
From beginning to end,

365
00:21:40,760 --> 00:21:42,600
His Majesty arranged all of it to destroy
me.

366
00:21:44,880 --> 00:21:46,920
I, Gu Qin, have been loyal all my life.

367
00:21:49,640 --> 00:21:51,040
Daning is the one that failed me!

368
00:21:51,120 --> 00:21:53,080
You still dare speak of loyalty?

369
00:21:57,760 --> 00:22:00,160
Power has blinded you.

370
00:22:01,120 --> 00:22:02,440
You colluded with the Blood Moon Society

371
00:22:02,520 --> 00:22:03,920
and leaked the border defenses.

372
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:05,160
You betrayed Daning long ago.

373
00:22:07,720 --> 00:22:09,240
Gu Qin, Right Chancellor of Daning,

374
00:22:10,040 --> 00:22:11,280
your crimes are proven beyond doubt.

375
00:22:12,040 --> 00:22:14,160
You are stripped of all rank and office

376
00:22:14,240 --> 00:22:15,400
and your three clans are to be
exterminated.

377
00:22:16,000 --> 00:22:17,840
Publish his crimes throughout the realm

378
00:22:18,960 --> 00:22:20,520
as a warning to all.

379
00:22:20,600 --> 00:22:21,440
Take him away.

380
00:22:27,320 --> 00:22:30,320
Meng Tinghui, I'll drag you down with me
today!

381
00:22:36,400 --> 00:22:37,840
You forced me to this!

382
00:22:37,920 --> 00:22:39,000
I'm innocent!

383
00:22:39,080 --> 00:22:40,560
I'm a flood-control hero!

384
00:22:40,640 --> 00:22:42,840
-You forced me!
-Gu Qin!

385
00:22:42,920 --> 00:22:44,560
The court's judgment

386
00:22:44,640 --> 00:22:45,640
is not the end of your reckoning.

387
00:22:47,040 --> 00:22:48,560
As Daning's so-called virtuous Chancellor,

388
00:22:49,800 --> 00:22:51,480
you should face the people's judgment.

389
00:22:51,560 --> 00:22:52,640
I'm innocent!

390
00:22:52,720 --> 00:22:54,880
Your Majesty, I'm a flood-control hero!

391
00:22:54,960 --> 00:22:56,120
I'm innocent!

392
00:22:56,200 --> 00:22:57,680
Take him away.

393
00:22:57,760 --> 00:22:58,680
I'm innocent!

394
00:22:58,760 --> 00:23:00,840
I'm the flood-control hero!

395
00:23:00,920 --> 00:23:02,120
Let go of me!

396
00:23:02,200 --> 00:23:03,920
I'm the flood-control hero!

397
00:23:28,920 --> 00:23:29,960
Zhili.

398
00:23:30,040 --> 00:23:31,320
You were very brave.

399
00:23:31,400 --> 00:23:32,600
If you need to cry, then cry.

400
00:23:32,680 --> 00:23:33,880
Mengmeng.

401
00:23:35,560 --> 00:23:37,480
Whenever I close my eyes now,

402
00:23:37,560 --> 00:23:40,120
I see him giving me the Heart-Lock,

403
00:23:41,160 --> 00:23:43,240
looking so gentle.

404
00:23:46,920 --> 00:23:49,480
It was all part of a trap he carefully
designed.

405
00:23:49,560 --> 00:23:50,520
I hate him.

406
00:23:51,680 --> 00:23:53,760
But I hate myself even more.

407
00:23:53,840 --> 00:23:56,240
He was wrong, not you.

408
00:23:56,320 --> 00:23:58,520
What you did today took extraordinary
courage.

409
00:23:58,600 --> 00:24:00,520
How many people could have done the same?

410
00:24:07,240 --> 00:24:08,600
You can begin again.

411
00:24:09,760 --> 00:24:10,600
Zhili.

412
00:24:10,680 --> 00:24:11,760
Your battlefield

413
00:24:12,320 --> 00:24:13,960
is not only in matters of the heart.

414
00:24:14,040 --> 00:24:15,080
It is also at the Office of Public
Inquiry,

415
00:24:15,160 --> 00:24:16,720
in case files and official records,

416
00:24:17,360 --> 00:24:18,800
and among the people of Daning.

417
00:24:19,680 --> 00:24:20,960
I'll be there with you.

418
00:24:34,000 --> 00:24:35,680
It's cold. Don't catch a chill.

419
00:24:40,600 --> 00:24:41,680
I want to walk by myself.

420
00:25:51,120 --> 00:25:53,880
I am Daning's greatest Chancellor.

421
00:25:55,960 --> 00:25:57,200
I controlled the floods,

422
00:25:57,280 --> 00:25:58,320
put down rebellions,

423
00:25:58,800 --> 00:26:00,240
and opened canals.

424
00:26:01,400 --> 00:26:03,440
I created this age of prosperity myself.

425
00:26:06,480 --> 00:26:07,800
Meng Tinghui.

426
00:26:08,440 --> 00:26:09,280
Look.

427
00:26:10,360 --> 00:26:11,200
The people...

428
00:26:12,240 --> 00:26:14,320
Look how they adore me.

429
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:16,680
Meng Tinghui, look.

430
00:26:17,640 --> 00:26:18,520
The people...

431
00:26:20,040 --> 00:26:21,800
Look how they adore me.

432
00:26:23,240 --> 00:26:24,960
All of you must remember me.

433
00:26:25,600 --> 00:26:27,760
I am Daning's greatest Chancellor.

434
00:26:27,840 --> 00:26:32,360
Gu Qin.

435
00:26:47,200 --> 00:26:49,880
I am Gu Qin, Daning's greatest Chancellor!

436
00:26:52,480 --> 00:26:55,080
You should all revere me!

437
00:26:56,640 --> 00:26:58,720
The hero who controlled the floods!

438
00:26:59,440 --> 00:27:02,080
I am Gu Qin, the flood-control hero!

439
00:27:06,280 --> 00:27:07,840
The dike has burst!

440
00:27:07,920 --> 00:27:08,960
The dike has burst!

441
00:27:09,040 --> 00:27:10,480
Hurry!

442
00:27:10,560 --> 00:27:12,240
People are dying! Hurry!

443
00:27:12,840 --> 00:27:14,320
Come with me to fight the flood!

444
00:27:25,320 --> 00:27:27,040
Quick, move the sandbags!

445
00:27:27,120 --> 00:27:28,080
Seal the breach!

446
00:27:28,160 --> 00:27:29,080
Hurry!

447
00:27:29,160 --> 00:27:30,600
Move the sandbags!

448
00:27:31,720 --> 00:27:32,840
With me, Gu Qin, here,

449
00:27:32,920 --> 00:27:34,440
the flood cannot hurt anyone!

450
00:27:36,480 --> 00:27:37,800
I'm the flood-control hero!

451
00:27:37,880 --> 00:27:39,520
I'm the flood-control hero!

452
00:27:42,520 --> 00:27:44,280
I'm the flood-control hero!

453
00:27:44,360 --> 00:27:45,200
I am...

454
00:28:39,480 --> 00:28:40,600
Chancellor.

455
00:28:40,680 --> 00:28:42,000
Gu Qin...

456
00:28:42,080 --> 00:28:43,360
is gone.

457
00:28:44,840 --> 00:28:46,400
He lost his mind

458
00:28:46,480 --> 00:28:47,720
and threw himself into the river.

459
00:28:49,080 --> 00:28:50,880
The man who controlled the floods

460
00:28:51,400 --> 00:28:52,880
ultimately died by water.

461
00:28:54,240 --> 00:28:56,600
Heaven's justice has come full circle.

462
00:28:56,680 --> 00:28:59,480
He was a Chancellor of the realm, after
all.

463
00:28:59,560 --> 00:29:01,480
Director Meng ordered

464
00:29:01,560 --> 00:29:03,160
the people's tribute umbrella burned in
the street.

465
00:29:03,240 --> 00:29:05,280
That only inflamed things further.

466
00:29:05,360 --> 00:29:07,280
The people are furious.

467
00:29:07,360 --> 00:29:09,200
They all watched his madness and disgrace.

468
00:29:09,280 --> 00:29:12,280
How long has Meng Tinghui served at court?

469
00:29:12,360 --> 00:29:14,880
More than three years, Chancellor.

470
00:29:14,960 --> 00:29:18,080
For these three years,
her methods have been extreme,

471
00:29:18,160 --> 00:29:19,680
stopping at nothing.

472
00:29:19,760 --> 00:29:21,640
The court and the realm are in turmoil,

473
00:29:21,720 --> 00:29:23,080
and the law has grown lax.

474
00:29:23,760 --> 00:29:26,160
Gu Qin deserved death ten thousand times
over,

475
00:29:26,240 --> 00:29:28,840
but some of what he said was true.

476
00:29:29,600 --> 00:29:32,800
Now newcomers hold sway in Daning,

477
00:29:32,880 --> 00:29:34,240
while veteran ministers have nowhere to
turn.

478
00:29:34,320 --> 00:29:36,680
I have served through three reigns.

479
00:29:37,880 --> 00:29:39,880
Yet when I look at the court today,

480
00:29:43,480 --> 00:29:45,960
it feels utterly unfamiliar.

481
00:30:03,000 --> 00:30:04,600
Grand Tutor,

482
00:30:04,680 --> 00:30:06,640
stop pretending not to hear.

483
00:30:07,400 --> 00:30:09,800
Zhili was once so celebrated.

484
00:30:09,880 --> 00:30:11,800
She was the prospective Empress.

485
00:30:11,880 --> 00:30:14,120
And now the whole capital knows

486
00:30:14,200 --> 00:30:15,360
she met the Right Chancellor
in secret at night

487
00:30:15,440 --> 00:30:17,840
and was entangled with her own teacher.

488
00:30:21,160 --> 00:30:22,120
Cousin,

489
00:30:22,200 --> 00:30:24,080
we are family.

490
00:30:24,160 --> 00:30:25,560
Naturally, I only want what's best for
Zhili.

491
00:30:25,640 --> 00:30:26,720
My nephew

492
00:30:27,400 --> 00:30:28,720
is about Zhili's age

493
00:30:28,800 --> 00:30:30,080
and is a scholar.

494
00:30:31,160 --> 00:30:33,120
His wife died two years ago,

495
00:30:33,200 --> 00:30:34,400
and he has not remarried.

496
00:30:34,480 --> 00:30:35,520
While he is still willing to marry her,

497
00:30:36,200 --> 00:30:37,640
why not let Zhili wed him?

498
00:30:37,720 --> 00:30:40,040
Zhili will never let idle gossip

499
00:30:40,120 --> 00:30:41,720
ruin her future.

500
00:30:41,800 --> 00:30:43,960
Her marriage is hers to decide.

501
00:30:44,040 --> 00:30:45,440
Even if she never marries,

502
00:30:45,520 --> 00:30:46,880
we will gladly care for her all her life.

503
00:30:46,960 --> 00:30:48,240
You needn't concern yourself.

504
00:30:49,600 --> 00:30:51,960
The tea is cold. Please leave.

505
00:30:56,840 --> 00:30:57,960
Grand Tutor,

506
00:30:58,720 --> 00:31:00,240
the Shen family today

507
00:31:00,320 --> 00:31:02,080
is not what it once was.

508
00:31:02,160 --> 00:31:03,880
The whole city is saying

509
00:31:03,960 --> 00:31:05,560
Zhili knew all along

510
00:31:05,640 --> 00:31:07,560
that the Chancellor murdered his wife and
child.

511
00:31:07,640 --> 00:31:09,080
Some even say she was his accomplice.

512
00:31:09,160 --> 00:31:10,080
If that were true,

513
00:31:10,160 --> 00:31:12,440
wouldn't your entire household
be executed?

514
00:31:13,760 --> 00:31:15,480
Gu Qin was a monster who killed his own
family.

515
00:31:15,560 --> 00:31:18,160
Zhili was the one who brought him to
justice.

516
00:31:18,240 --> 00:31:19,880
How does that make her an accomplice?

517
00:31:21,680 --> 00:31:23,200
If you dare spread such nonsense again,

518
00:31:23,280 --> 00:31:25,320
do not blame me for showing no courtesy.

519
00:31:25,400 --> 00:31:27,520
So much for my good intentions.

520
00:31:27,600 --> 00:31:28,600
Fine. Just you wait.

521
00:31:28,680 --> 00:31:29,600
Sooner or later, the Shen family

522
00:31:29,680 --> 00:31:31,400
will be ruined by Zhili.

523
00:31:31,480 --> 00:31:32,840
Get out!

524
00:31:34,720 --> 00:31:35,840
Fine, I'm leaving!

525
00:31:35,920 --> 00:31:37,240
I wouldn't come back even if you begged
me.

526
00:31:40,760 --> 00:31:41,960
At the palace banquet,

527
00:31:43,000 --> 00:31:45,880
when Zhili exposed that villain's true
face,

528
00:31:45,960 --> 00:31:47,360
I thought she was simply heartbroken.

529
00:31:48,480 --> 00:31:49,640
Now I realize

530
00:31:50,680 --> 00:31:52,360
she was trying to prove her own innocence.

531
00:31:53,000 --> 00:31:55,360
Rumors are everywhere now.

532
00:31:55,920 --> 00:31:57,000
Our Zhili...

533
00:31:57,800 --> 00:31:58,840
how can she bear all this?

534
00:31:59,560 --> 00:32:00,480
From now on,

535
00:32:00,560 --> 00:32:03,120
if anyone dares call Zhili an accomplice,

536
00:32:03,840 --> 00:32:06,880
I, Shen Wuchen, will stake
my life's reputation

537
00:32:08,160 --> 00:32:09,840
and fight them to the end.

538
00:32:09,920 --> 00:32:10,760
That's right.

539
00:32:12,120 --> 00:32:14,000
Whatever it costs us,

540
00:32:14,080 --> 00:32:15,600
we will protect Zhili.

541
00:32:15,680 --> 00:32:17,920
If she wants to investigate cases,
we'll investigate with her.

542
00:32:18,000 --> 00:32:19,640
If she needs shelter,
we'll spread our wings over her.

543
00:32:19,720 --> 00:32:21,240
No one will be allowed to bully her.

544
00:32:33,240 --> 00:32:36,960
Little children, don't be greedy.

545
00:32:37,040 --> 00:32:40,520
After Laba comes the New Year.

546
00:32:40,600 --> 00:32:43,680
Drink Laba porridge for a few days,

547
00:32:43,760 --> 00:32:46,680
and soon it's the twenty-third.

548
00:32:50,760 --> 00:32:51,800
In past years at Laba,

549
00:32:51,880 --> 00:32:53,360
the residence was always full of guests.

550
00:32:53,960 --> 00:32:55,480
The Grand Tutor could barely keep up.

551
00:32:56,200 --> 00:32:57,880
Yet it is already this late today,

552
00:32:57,960 --> 00:32:59,920
and not one person has come with a holiday
gift.

553
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:02,120
After what happened in our household,

554
00:33:02,200 --> 00:33:04,280
the court officials all keep their
distance.

555
00:33:04,360 --> 00:33:06,120
But didn't Director Meng say

556
00:33:06,200 --> 00:33:07,840
Gu Qin deceived the young lady?

557
00:33:08,560 --> 00:33:10,360
Rumors can be frightening.

558
00:33:14,200 --> 00:33:15,120
-Madam.
-Madam.

559
00:33:29,400 --> 00:33:30,800
Today is the Laba Festival.

560
00:33:31,640 --> 00:33:33,520
May Father and Mother enjoy
long life and good health.

561
00:33:34,240 --> 00:33:35,280
Good girl. Zhili.

562
00:33:36,000 --> 00:33:37,280
Sit down.

563
00:33:37,360 --> 00:33:39,080
We're family. No need for ceremony.

564
00:33:48,520 --> 00:33:49,480
Where is Anian?

565
00:33:50,160 --> 00:33:51,240
Why isn't he here?

566
00:33:53,200 --> 00:33:54,480
Commandant Di went out today

567
00:33:54,560 --> 00:33:55,840
and has not yet returned.

568
00:33:59,560 --> 00:34:00,880
And Zhishu too.

569
00:34:02,080 --> 00:34:03,720
He has been gone so long

570
00:34:03,800 --> 00:34:05,960
without sending a single letter.

571
00:34:06,040 --> 00:34:07,960
He has always loved the holidays.

572
00:34:09,000 --> 00:34:10,960
But winter is so cold.

573
00:34:11,040 --> 00:34:12,720
I wonder whether, out there,

574
00:34:12,800 --> 00:34:14,760
he is taking proper care of himself.

575
00:34:14,840 --> 00:34:16,120
Children each have their own fate.

576
00:34:17,640 --> 00:34:18,480
They are grown now.

577
00:34:19,160 --> 00:34:20,960
Sooner or later, they must leave home
and stand on their own.

578
00:34:21,960 --> 00:34:23,960
Let's eat before the food gets cold.

579
00:34:24,800 --> 00:34:25,800
Go on, eat.

580
00:34:31,520 --> 00:34:32,360
Eat.

581
00:34:34,160 --> 00:34:35,000
Here.

582
00:34:42,760 --> 00:34:44,440
You've been recuperating at home
for quite some time.

583
00:34:45,440 --> 00:34:46,760
When do you plan to return
to the Office of Public Inquiry?

584
00:34:48,560 --> 00:34:49,760
After the festival,

585
00:34:50,520 --> 00:34:52,000
I will return to the Office.

586
00:34:53,320 --> 00:34:54,560
From now on,

587
00:34:54,640 --> 00:34:56,000
I will hold myself to a stricter standard.

588
00:34:56,960 --> 00:34:58,680
Before, I misjudged someone

589
00:34:59,680 --> 00:35:01,000
and damaged our family's good name.

590
00:35:01,880 --> 00:35:03,040
Zhili.

591
00:35:03,120 --> 00:35:04,920
When we allowed you to sit the exams
and enter government,

592
00:35:05,000 --> 00:35:07,720
it was so you could stand on your own
merits,

593
00:35:08,400 --> 00:35:10,400
not be trapped by affairs of the heart.

594
00:35:11,160 --> 00:35:12,360
Now,

595
00:35:12,440 --> 00:35:14,760
you must not let other people's gossip

596
00:35:15,400 --> 00:35:17,080
break your proud spirit.

597
00:35:18,520 --> 00:35:19,640
Your father is right.

598
00:35:19,720 --> 00:35:21,000
Since you were little,

599
00:35:21,080 --> 00:35:23,840
we forbade "Admonitions for Women"
and "Rules for Women"

600
00:35:24,760 --> 00:35:27,240
precisely because we did not want
such stale teachings

601
00:35:27,320 --> 00:35:28,880
to constrain your spirit.

602
00:35:29,600 --> 00:35:30,680
A few days ago,

603
00:35:30,760 --> 00:35:32,440
your father was simply too anxious.

604
00:35:33,200 --> 00:35:34,040
Eat.

605
00:35:37,320 --> 00:35:38,520
Grand Tutor. Madam.

606
00:35:38,600 --> 00:35:39,920
An honored guest has arrived.

607
00:35:52,280 --> 00:35:54,480
Grand Tutor Shen. Madam Shen.

608
00:35:55,240 --> 00:35:56,320
Peace year after year.

609
00:35:56,840 --> 00:35:57,680
May all your wishes come true.

610
00:36:00,200 --> 00:36:02,000
Thank you, Director Meng.

611
00:36:02,520 --> 00:36:04,680
Grand Tutor, I did not come today

612
00:36:04,760 --> 00:36:06,200
in my capacity as Director.

613
00:36:06,280 --> 00:36:08,440
His Majesty wished to come in person.

614
00:36:08,520 --> 00:36:10,800
But he said that, given
the Shen family's situation,

615
00:36:10,880 --> 00:36:12,240
if he could not come himself

616
00:36:12,320 --> 00:36:13,440
and share a bowl of porridge with you,

617
00:36:14,000 --> 00:36:15,320
his heart would not be at ease.

618
00:36:16,040 --> 00:36:17,720
Yet if he came in person,

619
00:36:17,800 --> 00:36:20,360
he would place the Shen family
at the center of even more attention.

620
00:36:20,440 --> 00:36:22,640
So His Majesty sent me in his place.

621
00:36:24,000 --> 00:36:24,840
His Majesty...

622
00:36:27,760 --> 00:36:29,720
I am unworthy of such grace.

623
00:36:29,800 --> 00:36:31,000
His Majesty also said

624
00:36:31,080 --> 00:36:33,200
that tonight he would remain in the palace

625
00:36:33,280 --> 00:36:35,120
and drink this same porridge
with the Shen family in spirit,

626
00:36:35,200 --> 00:36:36,080
sharing this night with you.

627
00:36:38,200 --> 00:36:39,360
I,

628
00:36:39,440 --> 00:36:40,560
Shen Wuchen,

629
00:36:41,120 --> 00:36:42,560
thank His Majesty for his grace.

630
00:36:53,800 --> 00:36:55,240
His Majesty's kindness has reached us.

631
00:36:55,320 --> 00:36:56,960
But I still have a personal wish of my
own.

632
00:36:58,080 --> 00:36:59,560
I was worried about Zhili,

633
00:36:59,640 --> 00:37:00,560
so I came without invitation.

634
00:37:01,480 --> 00:37:02,960
I hoped to spend this festival

635
00:37:03,040 --> 00:37:04,040
together with the Shen family.

636
00:37:04,120 --> 00:37:05,120
Would that be all right?

637
00:37:05,200 --> 00:37:06,960
It was kind of you to come.

638
00:37:07,040 --> 00:37:08,240
We are all family.

639
00:37:08,320 --> 00:37:09,960
We are happiest when you visit often.

640
00:37:10,040 --> 00:37:11,480
When Fuzhi returns,

641
00:37:12,160 --> 00:37:13,720
I'll bring her here too,
and we can all celebrate together.

642
00:37:13,800 --> 00:37:15,120
Wonderful.

643
00:37:15,200 --> 00:37:17,920
Then, Husband, you'll have to
show off your cooking.

644
00:37:18,000 --> 00:37:19,920
We'll give the two of you a proper feast.

645
00:37:23,600 --> 00:37:24,440
Gladly.

646
00:37:30,680 --> 00:37:31,680
Zhili.

647
00:37:32,240 --> 00:37:33,240
Come back soon.

648
00:37:33,320 --> 00:37:34,920
Without you there,

649
00:37:35,000 --> 00:37:36,560
the tea at the Office

650
00:37:36,640 --> 00:37:38,400
even tastes bland.

651
00:37:40,240 --> 00:37:41,080
I will.

652
00:37:45,600 --> 00:37:46,440
Anian?

653
00:37:49,840 --> 00:37:51,200
What are you doing?

654
00:37:52,680 --> 00:37:54,120
From today onward,

655
00:37:54,880 --> 00:37:55,960
I am moving out of the Shen residence.

656
00:38:00,960 --> 00:38:02,600
Father. Mother.

657
00:38:04,120 --> 00:38:05,720
When my father, the Duke of Wu,

658
00:38:05,800 --> 00:38:07,080
gave his life for the country,

659
00:38:08,080 --> 00:38:09,600
I was still very young.

660
00:38:09,680 --> 00:38:11,200
His Majesty wished me to inherit his
title,

661
00:38:11,280 --> 00:38:12,320
but I felt unworthy of it.

662
00:38:13,480 --> 00:38:15,880
Now I am grown and have earned some merit.

663
00:38:16,680 --> 00:38:19,080
Today, I asked His Majesty
to grant me the title.

664
00:38:19,800 --> 00:38:21,600
I will leave the Shen household
and establish a home of my own.

665
00:38:22,600 --> 00:38:23,560
So today,

666
00:38:24,440 --> 00:38:26,000
I wish to formally ask you both

667
00:38:27,280 --> 00:38:29,040
for Shen Zhili's hand in marriage.

668
00:38:34,960 --> 00:38:36,200
You...

669
00:38:36,280 --> 00:38:38,280
Anian, why are you proposing so suddenly?

670
00:38:38,360 --> 00:38:40,480
The two of you are brother and sister.

671
00:38:40,560 --> 00:38:42,560
But we are not related by blood.

672
00:38:43,520 --> 00:38:44,640
I call you Father and Mother

673
00:38:44,720 --> 00:38:46,560
because you both raised me.

674
00:38:46,640 --> 00:38:48,920
The court is full of rumors now,

675
00:38:49,560 --> 00:38:51,320
yet the Privy Council alone remains quiet.

676
00:38:51,400 --> 00:38:53,360
That is because its veteran generals

677
00:38:53,440 --> 00:38:55,360
once served under my father.

678
00:38:55,440 --> 00:38:56,880
If Zhili marries me,

679
00:38:56,960 --> 00:38:58,720
they will surely speak up
for the Shen family.

680
00:38:58,800 --> 00:38:59,840
Then no one will dare

681
00:38:59,920 --> 00:39:02,040
slander Zhili or the Shen family's name.

682
00:39:02,120 --> 00:39:02,960
Anian.

683
00:39:03,040 --> 00:39:05,600
We understand and appreciate your
sincerity.

684
00:39:05,680 --> 00:39:07,720
But this concerns your entire life.

685
00:39:07,800 --> 00:39:09,560
How can you make such a hasty decision

686
00:39:09,640 --> 00:39:11,000
just because the Shen family is in
trouble?

687
00:39:11,080 --> 00:39:13,760
His Majesty sent Director Meng today

688
00:39:14,960 --> 00:39:16,840
precisely to show the entire realm

689
00:39:16,920 --> 00:39:19,560
that he stands with the Shen family.

690
00:39:19,640 --> 00:39:22,360
The criticism outside will soon die down.

691
00:39:23,000 --> 00:39:23,840
Good child.

692
00:39:24,520 --> 00:39:25,920
Marriage is a serious matter.

693
00:39:26,000 --> 00:39:27,280
You must never wrong yourself for our
sake.

694
00:39:27,360 --> 00:39:30,240
You should marry someone you truly love.

695
00:39:30,320 --> 00:39:31,160
Get up.

696
00:39:31,240 --> 00:39:32,240
Come, get up.

697
00:39:35,920 --> 00:39:36,960
Father.

698
00:39:37,960 --> 00:39:39,440
I have loved Zhili for a long time.

699
00:39:41,520 --> 00:39:43,000
In my heart, Zhili

700
00:39:43,080 --> 00:39:43,920
is more precious than any treasure.

701
00:39:45,200 --> 00:39:47,080
I cannot bear anyone speaking ill of her.

702
00:39:48,200 --> 00:39:49,040
I am establishing my own household

703
00:39:49,120 --> 00:39:50,760
because I want to give her the very best.

704
00:39:51,400 --> 00:39:52,240
I know

705
00:39:53,040 --> 00:39:55,040
this is still not enough to prove my
sincerity.

706
00:39:55,680 --> 00:39:57,640
So I am willing to accept

707
00:39:57,720 --> 00:39:59,240
any test Father and Mother set for me.

708
00:40:05,560 --> 00:40:06,560
Anian.

709
00:40:08,320 --> 00:40:09,920
I have watched you grow up.

710
00:40:10,840 --> 00:40:12,920
You have always been brave and
disciplined.

711
00:40:13,880 --> 00:40:15,320
Though you are young,

712
00:40:15,400 --> 00:40:17,240
you have always been

713
00:40:17,800 --> 00:40:19,160
steady in word and deed.

714
00:40:25,040 --> 00:40:25,880
However,

715
00:40:26,840 --> 00:40:28,040
as for Zhili's marriage,

716
00:40:29,120 --> 00:40:30,800
we will never force her.

717
00:40:31,360 --> 00:40:32,560
Zhili herself

718
00:40:33,480 --> 00:40:34,600
will make the decision.
